Example for how to fill out the template: https://github.com/pingcap/tidb/issues/20100

#### 1. Root Cause Analysis (RCA) (optional) 
<!-- Write down the reason why this bug occurs -->
The `amend transaction` processing may cause inconsistency issue.

#### 2. Symptom (optional)
The index data is missing after transaction amend.

<!-- What will the user see when this bug occurs. The error message may be in the terminal, log or monitoring -->

#### 3. All Trigger Conditions (optional)
Prewrite request size are big so that duplicated key requests are dispatched in different prewrite requests. That is amend transaction with large size.
- enable the transaction amend utility using `tidb_enable_amend_pessimistic_txn`.
- commit large txn while do the add index DDLs concurrently.

<!-- All the user scenarios that may trigger this bug -->

#### 4. Workaround (optional)
Do not enable transaction amend in production in previous v4.0.7, v4.0.8 versions.

#### 5. Affected versions
v4.0.7, v4.0.8

